IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cpp-core`

-- Canada Pension Plan Regulations (C.R.C., c. 385), RELATED PROVISIONS (lines 1156 to 1162): two transitional
-- provisions of amending instruments, shown "for information" by the consolidation. Piece cr1. LAYER 1.
--
-- Each fixes the remittances to which an amendment applies. They still decide something for a person: whether a
-- remittance required on a given day falls under the amended text. The text does not say which amendments:
-- SOR/97-472 is a regulation amending these Regulations; 2015, c. 36 is an Act whose section 27(1) and (2) are not
-- in the text (what they amend is not stated here). The text carries no date of making or of coming into force
-- of the Regulations, and none is invented: these two application dates are the only dates the Regulations'
-- ranges fix.
-- "After October 1997" is read as from 1 November 1997, and "after 2015" as from 1 January 2016 (fork F20).

§ `Regulations, Related Provisions`

§§ `SOR/97-472, section 4`

-- 4 These Regulations apply to amounts and contributions required to be remitted to the Receiver General after
-- October 1997.
-- src:1159 | 4 These Regulations apply to amounts and contributions required to be remitted to the Receiver General after October 1997.
@ref Related Provision SOR/97-472, s 4 (src:1159)
GIVETH A DATE
`Related provision SOR/97-472, s 4 — the first day to which the Regulations apply` MEANS
    YearMonthDay 1997 11 1

@ref Related Provision SOR/97-472, s 4 (src:1159)
GIVEN `the day by which the amount or contribution was required to be remitted to the Receiver General` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Related provision SOR/97-472, s 4 — the Regulations apply to the amount or contribution` `the day by which the amount or contribution was required to be remitted to the Receiver General` MEANS
    `the day by which the amount or contribution was required to be remitted to the Receiver General` AT LEAST `Related provision SOR/97-472, s 4 — the first day to which the Regulations apply`

§§ `2015, c. 36, section 27(3)`

-- 27 (3) Subsections (1) and (2) apply to amounts and contributions required to be remitted to the Receiver General
-- after 2015.
-- src:1162 | 27 (3) Subsections (1) and (2) apply to amounts and contributions required to be remitted to the Receiver General after 2015.
@ref Related Provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) (src:1162)
GIVETH A DATE
`Related provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) — the first day to which subsections (1) and (2) apply` MEANS
    YearMonthDay 2016 1 1

@ref Related Provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) (src:1162)
GIVEN `the day by which the amount or contribution was required to be remitted to the Receiver General` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Related provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) — subsections (1) and (2) apply to the amount or contribution` `the day by which the amount or contribution was required to be remitted to the Receiver General` MEANS
    `the day by which the amount or contribution was required to be remitted to the Receiver General` AT LEAST `Related provision 2015, c. 36, s 27(3) — the first day to which subsections (1) and (2) apply`
